WEBVTT

00:00:02.903 --> 00:00:06.703
The beginning breeze

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:10.974
Delivers this message

00:00:11.412 --> 00:00:19.979
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:21.655
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:21.655 --> 00:00:29.697
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:29.697 --> 00:00:29.992
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:37.500
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:37.738 --> 00:00:41.868
But please don't look back

00:00:42.009 --> 00:00:46.036
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:50.342
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:54.053
Can you see it too?

00:00:54.321 --> 00:00:58.223
The beginning breeze

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:02.356
Delivers this message

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:10.965
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:11.338 --> 00:01:19.541
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:29.651
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:37.655
A long, long time ago...

00:01:37.731 --> 00:01:41.599
...in an era when demons of the
mountain forest ravaged the lands...

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:46.929
...a young man came forth from
amidst the endless chaos.

00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:49.334
Seeking peace and order
for the people...

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:51.935
...he beat back
the rampaging demons.

00:01:52.246 --> 00:01:53.770
Moved by the man's spirit...

00:01:53.847 --> 00:01:57.613
...eight enlightened beings
gathered to join him.

00:01:57.951 --> 00:01:59.919
Bearing the names of colors...

00:01:59.987 --> 00:02:02.820
...they came to be called
the Eight Colored Enlightened Ones.

00:02:02.923 --> 00:02:06.290
Using their mysterious powers,
they helped the young man.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.087
The man's name was Sogen.

00:02:09.196 --> 00:02:11.357
With the wisdom
of the Eight Enlightened Ones...

00:02:11.432 --> 00:02:14.094
...he brought a new dawn
to the people.

00:02:14.168 --> 00:02:17.797
He was the first ruler of Saiunkoku,
the Kingdom of Colored Clouds.

00:02:20.741 --> 00:02:22.402
Following the death of Sogen...

00:02:22.476 --> 00:02:25.309
...the Eight Colored
Enlightened Ones disappeared...

00:02:26.013 --> 00:02:29.278
...but it is said that they still
live among the people.

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:30.984
So it may be that, even now,
they are here living among us.

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:34.021
Shurei Hong
So it may be that, even now,
they are here living among us.

00:02:34.021 --> 00:02:35.545
Shurei Hong

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:41.750
Every Good Deal Has A Catch

00:02:43.931 --> 00:02:46.559
Hey, Teacher Shurei.

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:47.930
What is it, Toka?

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:49.400
I heard that the shrine...

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:52.906
...that the Enlightened Ones lived in
still stands in the palace. Is that true?

00:02:52.973 --> 00:02:54.167
Yes.

00:02:54.341 --> 00:02:56.775
It's now called the Ministry
of the Enlightened Ones' Cave...

00:02:56.844 --> 00:02:59.574
...and still stands in one corner
of the palace grounds...

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:01.614
...or so Seiran tells me.

00:03:01.849 --> 00:03:03.908
You haven't seen it, Teacher?

00:03:03.984 --> 00:03:05.975
I cannot enter the palace.

00:03:06.553 --> 00:03:09.147
Because girls can't become
government officials.

00:03:09.223 --> 00:03:12.715
In that case, I'll become an official
and marry you!

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:15.821
That way, I can take you
to the castle, right?

00:03:15.896 --> 00:03:18.865
But you'd have to study
a lot more for that, Ryushin.

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:22.797
You're more suited to becoming
a military officer, Ryushin.

00:03:25.906 --> 00:03:26.873
Seiran.

00:03:27.741 --> 00:03:29.009
Seiran Si

00:03:29.009 --> 00:03:30.670
Seiran Si
My Lady.

00:03:31.445 --> 00:03:33.276
It's almost time.

00:03:33.347 --> 00:03:34.439
Yes.

00:03:35.516 --> 00:03:39.282
That's right, I have to work again today!
Let's go, Seiran!

00:03:42.289 --> 00:03:44.154
The daughter of the Hong Clan?

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:48.991
Correct. Her father, Shoka Hong,
is in charge of the archives.

00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:53.666
The Hong Clan is one of the most
distinguished of the top families.

00:03:53.767 --> 00:03:55.997
There's no problem
with her family lineage, but...!

00:03:56.069 --> 00:03:59.527
However, an archivist's salary
isn't likely to be much.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:03.235
Indeed, they're having difficulty
making ends meet...

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:06.108
...and his daughter
is working several jobs.

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:11.781
And you think this girl will be useful
in solving this major problem, Sho?

00:04:11.885 --> 00:04:13.079
Indeed.

00:04:13.554 --> 00:04:16.955
It's been almost six months since
His Majesty ascended to the throne.

00:04:17.024 --> 00:04:20.084
I figured things would have turned out
better than they have.

00:04:20.227 --> 00:04:24.755
At this rate, it's only a matter of time
before someone goes after the throne.

00:04:25.999 --> 00:04:27.523
That's true.

00:04:27.601 --> 00:04:30.001
In any case, leave it to me.

00:04:31.038 --> 00:04:36.601
After all, it's commonly said that
a man's greatest enemy is his wife.

00:04:38.779 --> 00:04:41.714
Restaurant

00:05:05.072 --> 00:05:06.471
Seiran!

00:05:07.407 --> 00:05:09.671
What is it, Ryushin?

00:05:09.943 --> 00:05:11.308
Mr. Shoka's...!

00:05:14.681 --> 00:05:17.582
What's with suddenly calling me
back home?

00:05:17.651 --> 00:05:20.586
Something about an important guest
coming to pay a visit.

00:05:20.654 --> 00:05:21.484
Well, who?!

00:05:21.555 --> 00:05:26.151
I don't know, but Master said
to return right away, so...!

00:05:29.529 --> 00:05:32.157
That was a pretty good job, too.

00:05:32.266 --> 00:05:36.498
But since I only played one tune,
they cut back drastically on my pay!

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:40.131
And here I was thinking
we'd be able to buy rice this month!

00:05:40.207 --> 00:05:42.698
But instead it's barley again!
Barley!

00:05:42.876 --> 00:05:47.370
That line that runs along barley,
the line that distinguishes it from rice.

00:05:47.447 --> 00:05:50.848
No doubt it's gonna taunt me
this month too, saying "I'm not rice!"

00:05:51.385 --> 00:05:53.785
I can't believe it! I can't believe it!

00:05:53.887 --> 00:05:56.617
My Lady.
Barley doesn't talk.

00:05:56.757 --> 00:06:00.056
It'll be fine.
I'll take on more side jobs.

00:06:01.161 --> 00:06:02.753
I'm sorry, Seiran.

00:06:03.964 --> 00:06:06.159
You'd be more than able
to support yourself...

00:06:06.233 --> 00:06:08.827
...as a respectable imperial officer
assigned to the Court.

00:06:09.703 --> 00:06:12.263
You don't need to worry
about that.

00:06:12.339 --> 00:06:16.275
Rather, I'm just happy to be able
to pay back the debt I owe.

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:18.577
Debt?

00:06:22.282 --> 00:06:27.185
Thirteen years ago, even though you
didn't know where I came from...

00:06:27.287 --> 00:06:29.380
...you took me into your home.

00:06:29.823 --> 00:06:35.193
I decided to pay you back
for that debt for the rest of my life.

00:06:35.996 --> 00:06:37.463
Seiran.

00:06:42.069 --> 00:06:44.333
Why are we paid so little?!

00:06:44.504 --> 00:06:45.937
Only our social rank is high.

00:06:46.006 --> 00:06:48.702
- I hate being poor!
- M-My Lady, people are watching!

00:06:48.775 --> 00:06:52.142
I really hate being poor!

00:06:54.981 --> 00:06:58.109
The wall's collapsing again.
And the roof tiles are broken.

00:06:58.185 --> 00:07:01.848
Repairing this ridiculously large
mansion takes the most money.

00:07:01.922 --> 00:07:04.117
When you repair one part,
another part falls apart.

00:07:04.191 --> 00:07:05.818
I can't stand it!

00:07:05.992 --> 00:07:08.187
I'll take care of repairing the wall.

00:07:08.295 --> 00:07:11.594
And I can get some tiles from
the castle to replace the broken ones.

00:07:15.268 --> 00:07:17.736
It seems like the guest
has already arrived.

00:07:18.338 --> 00:07:20.772
Oh, no!
I have to prepare the tea!

00:07:21.174 --> 00:07:24.940
In that case, I'll go inform them
that her ladyship has returned.

00:07:27.781 --> 00:07:31.273
I guess you at least made the effort
to serve tea, right, father?

00:07:37.224 --> 00:07:39.192
My Lady, this is serious!

00:07:39.259 --> 00:07:40.658
What's the matter, Seiran?

00:07:40.727 --> 00:07:44.219
Apparently,
the guest is Advisor Sho!

00:07:47.033 --> 00:07:51.402
A-Advisor Sho?
One of the court's Three Elders?

00:07:53.407 --> 00:07:55.705
Why is such an important
person here?

00:07:55.776 --> 00:07:58.711
He said he'd explain
when you came.

00:07:59.179 --> 00:08:03.639
Why?! Whatever the case, we must
be sure not to show any disrespect.

00:08:04.584 --> 00:08:07.052
Ever since I was
put in charge of the archives...

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:09.020
...I have been enjoying
my work very...!

00:08:09.089 --> 00:08:11.023
Lady Shurei has arrived.

00:08:11.358 --> 00:08:13.019
Oh, come in.

00:08:16.229 --> 00:08:17.924
Please excuse me.

00:08:19.666 --> 00:08:22.362
Hello, Shurei.
This is Advisor Sho.

00:08:25.272 --> 00:08:28.173
So this is Advisor Sho.
The leader of the hundred advisors.

00:08:28.241 --> 00:08:32.041
In this country, his authority
ranks second only to the king's.

00:08:39.586 --> 00:08:43.647
Lord Advisor Sho. Please forgive me
for keeping you waiting for so long.

00:08:44.157 --> 00:08:49.094
Although we have little to offer,
please make yourself comfortable.

00:08:51.164 --> 00:08:53.359
Please rise, Lady Shurei.

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.362
Yes, sir.

00:08:56.036 --> 00:08:57.833
Mr. Seiran, would you mind
coming over here, as well?

00:08:57.904 --> 00:09:00.805
After all, this matter involves
both of you.

00:09:02.476 --> 00:09:04.410
Ah, but before that...!

00:09:05.011 --> 00:09:10.108
Could I ask to have some tea?
This water is making me rather chilly.

00:09:10.183 --> 00:09:14.381
A bucket?! You mean, he brought
water directly from the well?!

00:09:15.021 --> 00:09:16.215
Father!

00:09:17.691 --> 00:09:20.717
- Why are you so proud of what you did?!
- Our well water is quite tasty, isn't it?

00:09:20.794 --> 00:09:24.821
I-I'm terribly sorry! I'll prepare
some tea for you right away!

00:09:28.635 --> 00:09:32.071
So you made this sweet bean bun
yourself, Lady Shurei?

00:09:32.138 --> 00:09:33.036
Yes.

00:09:33.106 --> 00:09:35.939
Shurei's sweet bean buns
are quite tasty.

00:09:36.243 --> 00:09:37.403
Allow me.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.604
This really is good!

00:09:41.982 --> 00:09:44.917
I added ground sesame to the
red bean paste, so it's not too sweet.

00:09:44.985 --> 00:09:47.112
You won't be able
to stop eating them.

00:09:47.187 --> 00:09:49.121
This is a wonderful dish.

00:09:49.189 --> 00:09:52.158
Mr. Shoka, you're very fortunate
to have such a talented daughter.

00:09:52.225 --> 00:09:53.192
Yes.

00:09:56.296 --> 00:09:58.958
Sir. You wanted to talk to us
about something.

00:09:59.566 --> 00:10:01.158
Ah, right.

00:10:01.368 --> 00:10:05.998
Lady Shurei and Mr. Seiran,
there's something I'd like to ask of you.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:08.667
Should you agree to it...

00:10:09.009 --> 00:10:12.376
...as a token of our gratitude,
I am prepared to pay you this much.

00:10:14.047 --> 00:10:16.709
H-How much exactly
are we talking about?

00:10:16.783 --> 00:10:18.944
Fifty bronze coins?
Five hundred coins?

00:10:22.122 --> 00:10:25.956
C-Could this actually
be a really sweet deal?

00:10:26.593 --> 00:10:28.959
You're not by chance saying
f-five silver coins?

00:10:31.231 --> 00:10:34.029
Fifty silver coins perhaps?

00:10:45.278 --> 00:10:47.610
It's five hundred gold coins!

00:10:55.956 --> 00:10:57.924
Five hundred...

00:10:58.391 --> 00:10:59.858
...gold coins.

00:11:04.931 --> 00:11:07.834
I'll do it! No matter what it involves!
You can count on me!

00:11:07.834 --> 00:11:12.794
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:26.419 --> 00:11:29.252
So this is the palace.
Incredible.

00:11:29.322 --> 00:11:31.722
I wonder how many times larger
this place is compared to ours.

00:11:31.791 --> 00:11:34.817
And I'm supposed to live in
a grand place like this from now on?

00:11:34.894 --> 00:11:36.657
What should I do, Seiran?!

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:38.357
It can't be helped, can it?

00:11:39.065 --> 00:11:40.862
M-My Lady.

00:11:40.934 --> 00:11:43.664
Are you sure about this?
We haven't heard yet what it involves.

00:11:43.737 --> 00:11:46.797
What are you saying, Seiran?!
It's five hundred gold coins!

00:11:46.873 --> 00:11:49.535
With that much, we'll be able
to eat white rice every day.

00:11:49.609 --> 00:11:52.635
We'll repair all the walls and roof tiles,
and we'll still have some left over.

00:11:52.712 --> 00:11:53.906
In that case.

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:58.842
Mr. Seiran will temporarily join the
personal guard troops, the Urin Army...

00:11:58.918 --> 00:12:00.977
...and be assigned to the king.

00:12:02.222 --> 00:12:03.951
And Lady Shurei.

00:12:04.457 --> 00:12:07.051
We would like for you to enter
the Imperial household...

00:12:07.127 --> 00:12:09.425
...and become the king's consort.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:14.359
Me? The king's... consort?!

00:12:16.069 --> 00:12:18.970
How could I have agreed
to such a thing?!

00:12:19.372 --> 00:12:21.169
Your response was immediate.

00:12:21.608 --> 00:12:24.736
What should I do?!
Seiran, help me out of this!

00:12:31.618 --> 00:12:34.712
We've been waiting for you,
Consort Shurei.

00:12:34.821 --> 00:12:36.982
Consort?
Oh, that's right.

00:12:37.457 --> 00:12:39.948
From now on,
this lady-in-waiting...

00:12:40.026 --> 00:12:43.484
...will be assigned to you and
take care of anything you may need.

00:12:44.664 --> 00:12:46.495
My name is Shusui.

00:12:46.833 --> 00:12:48.698
Act accordingly for a consort.

00:12:49.436 --> 00:12:54.533
I am Shurei Hong.
It is a pleasure to meet you, Shusui.

00:12:55.842 --> 00:13:00.108
How was that, Seiran?
Was that the correct impression?

00:13:04.384 --> 00:13:05.908
Okay, I'm on my way.

00:13:12.058 --> 00:13:14.822
From now on,
this is my room.

00:13:18.798 --> 00:13:19.992
Now, then.

00:13:21.367 --> 00:13:24.097
First, I'll start off by learning
more about the king.

00:13:24.771 --> 00:13:27.262
Current King of Saiunkoku,
Ryuki Shi.

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:28.864
First, about his family.

00:13:28.942 --> 00:13:31.137
While he was
the youngest of six sons...

00:13:31.211 --> 00:13:33.270
...four of his five elder brothers
killed one another...

00:13:33.346 --> 00:13:36.144
...in the struggle for the throne
eight years ago.

00:13:36.349 --> 00:13:40.046
The other remaining son
had been exiled long ago.

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:42.588
So as a result, he unexpectedly
rose to the throne.

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:46.816
So, in other words,
the throne just fell into his lap.

00:13:46.893 --> 00:13:48.861
Now, as for government
administration...!

00:13:49.028 --> 00:13:52.691
He doesn't attend Court,
and leaves everything to his subjects.

00:13:53.466 --> 00:13:55.093
So even though he's the king...

00:13:55.168 --> 00:13:57.898
...he has no interest
or desire to govern.

00:13:57.971 --> 00:14:00.098
And his private life...!

00:14:00.373 --> 00:14:04.002
He currently has
no consorts, but me.

00:14:04.778 --> 00:14:09.374
Rumor has it that
the king prefers men over women?

00:14:11.417 --> 00:14:13.385
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:14:15.421 --> 00:14:17.184
Well, you can't slack off
for half a year...

00:14:17.257 --> 00:14:19.589
...and expect things
to keep going smoothly.

00:14:20.093 --> 00:14:22.561
If we're not careful,
this country's gonna collapse.

00:14:22.929 --> 00:14:25.796
I can understand now why
Advisor Sho was so desperate.

00:14:26.199 --> 00:14:30.465
Please! Please!
Turn His Majesty into a proper king!

00:14:30.537 --> 00:14:32.198
Within half a year!

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:37.305
No wonder he's paying me
five hundred gold coins.

00:14:38.645 --> 00:14:42.046
I've learned my lesson.
Every good deal has a catch.

00:14:42.215 --> 00:14:43.375
Pardon me.

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:44.574
Yes?

00:14:45.585 --> 00:14:48.952
I brought you some flower tea...
Consort Shurei.

00:14:50.156 --> 00:14:52.215
Um... the daughter
of the lady-in-waiting.

00:14:52.292 --> 00:14:53.725
I believe her name's Korin.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:55.587
Thank you, Korin.

00:14:57.897 --> 00:15:01.993
She looks to be about thirteen.
She looks so innocent. She's cute.

00:15:08.541 --> 00:15:10.406
I-I'm so sorry!

00:15:11.377 --> 00:15:12.742
Are you all right?

00:15:16.916 --> 00:15:20.147
Wh-What have I done
to the Lady Consort?!

00:15:23.256 --> 00:15:25.224
Korin. Calm down.

00:15:25.758 --> 00:15:27.385
What is going on here?

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:28.688
Shusui!

00:15:30.864 --> 00:15:32.798
Lady Consort.

00:15:32.866 --> 00:15:34.766
I'm all right.

00:15:35.101 --> 00:15:38.434
Please do not scold Korin,
but get her to calm down.

00:15:39.239 --> 00:15:42.106
Very well.
Come, Korin.

00:15:42.175 --> 00:15:43.142
Yes.

00:15:43.476 --> 00:15:44.534
Korin.

00:15:45.945 --> 00:15:47.845
Once your tears have stopped...

00:15:47.914 --> 00:15:50.439
...would you be kind enough
to bring me some more flower tea?

00:15:53.519 --> 00:15:54.543
Yes.

00:16:18.711 --> 00:16:20.770
Such an impressive piece
of embroidery.

00:16:23.082 --> 00:16:24.947
This cup also looks expensive.

00:16:25.652 --> 00:16:28.883
The sale of one of these would
bring in enough to eat for a month.

00:16:29.489 --> 00:16:33.482
I'd be able to buy lots of sweets
for the kids at the temple school as well.

00:16:34.894 --> 00:16:37.488
Living in luxury without
taking care of his responsibilities...

00:16:37.563 --> 00:16:39.224
...simply because he's the king.

00:16:39.299 --> 00:16:41.267
I absolutely will not forgive him!

00:16:42.602 --> 00:16:45.093
Now that I've accepted,
I'll have to see it through!

00:16:45.171 --> 00:16:46.866
The retraining of this
pathetic king!

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:49.170
Well, it comes with
a time limit and a fee...

00:16:49.242 --> 00:16:51.301
...and food, clothing and shelter
are all guaranteed.

00:16:51.377 --> 00:16:53.845
He prefers men, so I don't have
to worry about the evenings.

00:16:53.913 --> 00:16:56.177
This isn't such a bad deal,
after all!

00:16:56.316 --> 00:17:00.878
You just wait! I'll beat that
irresponsible attitude out of you!

00:17:02.522 --> 00:17:05.855
Well, those were my intentions, but it's
already been five days since I arrived.

00:17:06.259 --> 00:17:09.057
When am I gonna have
the chance to meet the king?

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:14.195
Boy, this is so boring.
Don't you agree, Koyu?

00:17:14.267 --> 00:17:16.360
Since I was originally assigned
to guarding the king...

00:17:16.436 --> 00:17:18.199
...it's all right for me.

00:17:18.504 --> 00:17:20.062
But in your case...

00:17:20.139 --> 00:17:23.540
...you were assigned to the king without
consent at Advisor Sho's request.

00:17:23.609 --> 00:17:25.804
But you have yet
to meet the king, right?

00:17:25.878 --> 00:17:27.846
Regardless of how capable
an officer you are...

00:17:27.914 --> 00:17:30.883
...if you're not even given the chance,
you're just dead weight.

00:17:31.617 --> 00:17:35.109
Here we are, the best of the young
civil servants and military officers.

00:17:35.188 --> 00:17:38.555
We're supposed to be rising
through the ranks.

00:17:39.359 --> 00:17:42.590
Just shut the hell up and get lost,
Shuei Ran!

00:17:42.662 --> 00:17:45.324
My. That's no way to speak
to your friend, is it?

00:17:45.398 --> 00:17:47.127
Who are you calling "friend"?!

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:49.225
If you're a bodyguard,
why not get dressed like one...

00:17:49.302 --> 00:17:50.792
...and stick to that stupid king?!

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:54.101
But you know, the king wanders off
whenever he wants every day...

00:17:54.173 --> 00:17:56.107
...so I have no idea where he is.

00:17:56.275 --> 00:17:58.971
Damn! Does this country consider it
okay for things to be like they are?!

00:17:59.045 --> 00:18:02.071
Well, it seems like
Advisor Sho's come up with a plan.

00:18:02.148 --> 00:18:03.012
A plan?

00:18:03.082 --> 00:18:04.777
To get a wife for the king.

00:18:04.851 --> 00:18:07.149
A wife? Does he seriously expect
the king to change...

00:18:07.220 --> 00:18:08.209
...because of something
like that?!

00:18:08.287 --> 00:18:11.848
Your hatred toward women
remains very deep rooted.

00:18:11.924 --> 00:18:14.722
Nothing good comes out
of dealing with women!

00:18:15.028 --> 00:18:16.620
It's such a waste that
you don't know...

00:18:16.696 --> 00:18:19.426
...the pleasures of spending
the night with a woman.

00:18:19.499 --> 00:18:22.366
You're missing out
on half your life.

00:18:23.069 --> 00:18:25.833
More importantly,
who is this wife of the king?!

00:18:27.306 --> 00:18:28.773
Speak of the devil.

00:18:32.445 --> 00:18:33.605
This is great.

00:18:36.082 --> 00:18:37.913
Do you enjoy reading?

00:18:38.418 --> 00:18:40.545
Yes. Ah...!

00:18:40.987 --> 00:18:42.784
Pardon the delay
in introducing myself.

00:18:42.855 --> 00:18:46.416
I'm Shuei Ran, shogun of the
Left Urin Army. And this is...!

00:18:46.492 --> 00:18:47.959
I'm Koyu Ri
the Assistant Secretary...

00:18:48.027 --> 00:18:50.552
...of the Department of Civil Affairs
in charge of personnel.

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:52.894
- I'm Shurei Hong.
- Hong?

00:18:52.965 --> 00:18:55.991
I wonder if it would be all right
for me to borrow books from here.

00:18:56.335 --> 00:18:58.895
There's so much
that I must study now.

00:18:59.038 --> 00:19:00.300
For what reason?

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:02.901
For this country.

00:19:05.378 --> 00:19:09.246
Oh, if you'd like, help yourselves
to these sweet bean buns I made.

00:19:14.887 --> 00:19:17.287
Then I'll borrow this book, okay?

00:19:20.893 --> 00:19:21.882
So that's her?

00:19:21.961 --> 00:19:23.895
Yeah, wife of the stupid lord.

00:19:23.963 --> 00:19:25.988
And she's also
the daughter of Mr. Shoka...

00:19:26.065 --> 00:19:27.760
...whom you admire so much.

00:19:29.168 --> 00:19:34.196
The daughter of Mr. Shoka?
You think the king will change?

00:19:35.108 --> 00:19:36.871
Hard to say.

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:41.009
Although it does appear that things
are gonna become quite interesting.

00:19:42.982 --> 00:19:44.950
Wow.
So beautiful.

00:19:50.623 --> 00:19:52.284
I-I can't reach it.

00:19:57.463 --> 00:19:58.862
Do you want this?

00:20:12.879 --> 00:20:14.779
That was quite the gust of wind.

00:20:21.087 --> 00:20:22.418
You broke it?!

00:20:23.022 --> 00:20:26.458
That wasn't my intention,
but the wind startled me, so...!

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.058
Do you want it?

00:20:37.837 --> 00:20:41.705
You know, I just wanted some petals
to float in my tea.

00:20:41.807 --> 00:20:44.401
Won't you join me
for some sweet bean buns?

00:20:49.415 --> 00:20:50.575
Here you are.

00:20:51.184 --> 00:20:53.277
The cherry blossoms
are so beautiful...

00:20:53.519 --> 00:20:56.545
...so I thought why not have some tea
outside while reading a book?

00:21:00.126 --> 00:21:02.356
Are you Shoka's daughter,
by any chance?

00:21:02.728 --> 00:21:03.990
How did you guess?

00:21:04.597 --> 00:21:08.795
This tastes just like the homemade
sweet bean buns Shoka often brings.

00:21:09.335 --> 00:21:11.462
They're my favorite
sweet bean buns.

00:21:12.004 --> 00:21:13.096
Thank you.

00:21:13.873 --> 00:21:15.932
Is he an acquaintance of father?

00:21:16.309 --> 00:21:19.540
I'm Shurei Hong.
What's your name?

00:21:19.745 --> 00:21:20.712
M-My name?

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:23.078
Well, I won't know what to call you
unless you tell me.

00:21:24.083 --> 00:21:29.419
Sh-Shuei. You may call me...
ah, my name is... Shuei Ran.

00:21:29.522 --> 00:21:31.114
Shuei Ran?

00:21:43.269 --> 00:21:46.261
Wh-What I wanna know is,
what is Shoka's daughter doing here?

00:21:46.339 --> 00:21:50.298
M-Me? Um, I'm here on an errand
for the palace.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:53.572
But I'm finding it
difficult to meet with the king.

00:21:53.646 --> 00:21:56.706
How might I be able to meet with him,
Mr. Shuei Ran?

00:22:00.453 --> 00:22:02.478
So you wanna meet the king?

00:22:03.189 --> 00:22:04.213
Yes.

00:22:04.724 --> 00:22:06.589
What are you gonna do
when you meet him?

00:22:07.460 --> 00:22:09.428
What will you accomplish
by meeting him?

00:22:12.765 --> 00:22:14.426
I should be getting back.

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:26.207
Um, you haven't answered my question.
I know the king.

00:22:26.479 --> 00:22:29.004
If there's anything you want to tell him,
I'll relay the message.

00:22:31.117 --> 00:22:33.745
I've come to help the king.

00:22:36.722 --> 00:22:39.190
There are other things
I want to tell him as well...

00:22:39.425 --> 00:22:43.555
...but they are things that only
have meaning if I talk to him directly.

00:22:53.105 --> 00:22:55.232
Well then, see you later,
Mr. Shuei Ran.

00:23:02.748 --> 00:23:04.579
So they finally meet.

00:23:04.650 --> 00:23:06.618
I wonder how things
will proceed from here on.

00:23:06.686 --> 00:23:11.350
Now, let us see how Lady Shurei
manages things.

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:36.607
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:36.749 --> 00:23:43.313
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:43.422 --> 00:23:48.485
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:48.594 --> 00:23:53.588
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:54.667 --> 00:23:59.127
You say you'll be fine alone

00:24:00.673 --> 00:24:05.804
You are just like me

00:24:06.545 --> 00:24:11.073
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:11.150 --> 00:24:17.055
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:18.023 --> 00:24:23.825
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:23.929 --> 00:24:28.798
I will always think of you

00:24:29.935 --> 00:24:42.609
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.918 --> 00:24:46.352
Next Episode

00:24:46.352 --> 00:24:48.721
Next Episode
Five hundred gold coins,
I'm telling you! Five hundred!

00:24:48.721 --> 00:24:48.788
Next Episode

00:24:48.788 --> 00:24:52.091
Next Episode
A Frog in the Well
Knows Not About the Ocean
It's a case where I don't have to think
twice before accepting a job.

00:24:52.091 --> 00:24:55.294
Next Episode
A Frog in the Well
Knows Not About the Ocean
Mind you, I didn't expect I'd be asked
to become that stupid king's consort.

00:24:55.294 --> 00:24:55.461
Next Episode
A Frog in the Well
Knows Not About the Ocean

00:24:55.461 --> 00:24:55.561
Next Episode
A Frog in the Well
Knows Not About the Ocean
But I've accepted the job,
so I'll do what it takes.

00:24:55.561 --> 00:24:58.587
But I've accepted the job,
so I'll do what it takes.
